flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#1d2029,stroke:#555b68,color:#eceef1;
  classDef friction fill:#262a34,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:2px,color:#eceef1;
  classDef broken fill:#1d2029,stroke:#d77757,stroke-width:2px,color:#d77757;
  classDef byhand fill:#1d2029,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#eceef1;
  S1["1. Before the reset the countdown reads in days<br/>and hours, then hours and minutes.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. The reset passes with no session: 'Reset Sun<br/>17:00 no session since', the item dims; the old<br/>week keeps its figure and the new week says 'no<br/>reply yet'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. The reset passes while idle sessions feed: 'new<br/>window on the next reply'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. The next reply brings the new week: a low<br/>figure, 'On pace' or 'Ahead', a new row in week<br/>over week.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. Week over week keeps the highest value seen per<br/>week.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. At 100% the panda shows x x until the reset.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
